WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:02.600
Kaleido Star is about to begin.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.540
When you watch Kaleido Star,
keep your room brightly lit

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:07.840
and sit as far from the TV as you can.

00:00:07.840 --> 00:00:09.440
Yes, Miss!

00:00:11.010 --> 00:00:13.820
Well now! Cathy here!

00:00:13.820 --> 00:00:17.590
Are you burning with youth, everybody?!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:21.460
Let yourself go and get more revved up,
push yourself higher!

00:00:21.460 --> 00:00:25.290
Everybody here is running head-on
at his or her own dream!

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.200
This Kaleido Stage is looking pretty good!

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:31.530
All right! I've started to get revved up!

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:33.900
I'm gonna stick with you all like crazy,

00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.770
with this stage you've tried to protect!

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:47.850
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the beginning is
red and black passions</i>

00:00:40.510 --> 00:00:47.850
<i>Tattoo Kiss hajimari wa aka to kuro no Passion</i>

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:55.160
<i>Sometimes, we rely on our contrary hearts</i>

00:00:47.850 --> 00:00:55.160
<i>Toki ni urahara na kokoro o tayori ni</i>

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.260
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:56.260
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:01.920
<i>Tattoo Kiss, the last resort is a
mission which changes the future</i>

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:01.920
<i>Tattoo Kiss kirifuda wa mirai o kaeru Mission</i>

00:00:56.260 --> 00:01:01.920
New Wings

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:09.870
<i>There is no place for ambiguous answers in love</i>

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:09.870
<i>Koi ni aimai na kotae wa iranai</i>

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:17.340
<i>Even while pretending not to see the
impossible reality, we bet</i>

00:01:10.440 --> 00:01:17.340
<i>Arienai genjitsu minai furi shite mo Bet</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.610
<i>Hard to obtain truth. Can you feel me now?</i>

00:01:17.850 --> 00:01:23.610
<i>Egatai shinjitsu Can U feel me now?</i>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.160
<i>Say what to myself who gets excited easily?</i>

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:28.160
<i>Nesshiyasui jibun ni Say What?</i>

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>I'm confused, what to say</i>

00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:31.520
<i>Tomadou iibun</i>

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:40.740
<i>Dreamin' the never-waking dream,
the falling fate</i>

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:40.740
<i>Dreamin' samenai yume ochiteku sadame</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>Don't stop lovin' can't stop lovin' you
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>Don't stop lovin' Can't stop lovin' U
Ya ya ya</i>

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:55.850
<i>I believe in you even if I lose everything for it</i>

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:55.850
<i>Believe in U hikikae ni subete ushinatte mo</i>

00:01:55.850 --> 00:02:01.380
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' you
No no no</i>

00:01:55.850 --> 00:02:01.380
<i>Still lovin' can't stop lovin' U
No no no</i>

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.990
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:07.990
<i>Tattoo Kiss</i>

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:15.440
I've changed my mind.

00:02:16.740 --> 00:02:18.670
We'll start the special training again.

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:22.910
Yes, sir!

00:02:34.660 --> 00:02:37.660
Hurry up and get on your feet.
You're wasting time.

00:02:37.660 --> 00:02:39.220
Right...

00:02:58.210 --> 00:03:00.150
She's got so many weights on...

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:02.550
She's been at it nonstop since
early this morning.

00:03:09.690 --> 00:03:10.790
Want to take a break?

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.890
No.

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:17.300
Sora...

00:03:17.300 --> 00:03:20.600
Why does she have to keep going
until she collapses like that?

00:03:24.610 --> 00:03:26.700
I can... keep going...

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:28.780
Our Amazing Futures

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.810
Our Amazing Futures

00:03:28.780 --> 00:03:31.810
"Our Amazing Futures"

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.710
Our Amazing Futures

00:03:35.220 --> 00:03:38.550
Simon Park accepted the job of
writing the press copy.

00:03:38.550 --> 00:03:39.420
Mmm-hmm.

00:03:39.420 --> 00:03:42.520
Now, about Layla...

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.130
I have no intention of stopping Layla.

00:03:45.130 --> 00:03:47.230
You're a real piece of work.

00:03:47.230 --> 00:03:50.730
For the Angel's Maneuver you need
innate instinct.

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:54.640
Even Layla may not be able to bring it off
just by trying hard.

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.510
And people are sure to pass judgment

00:03:57.510 --> 00:04:00.810
on someone who leaves the stage and then
comes back to make a second attempt.

00:04:00.810 --> 00:04:04.680
She made a brilliant exit, but this could sully it.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.680
Do you mean to make her give up on this?

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.220
If I can.

00:04:08.220 --> 00:04:10.740
But if I can't...

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:14.680
I'll just have to sully my own reputation
along with her, that's all.

00:04:15.690 --> 00:04:16.830
What do you think?

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:20.960
During the actual performance, I plan to use
lasers in those places where I've put film here.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:27.300
Um, I think it's pretty good,
but something's missing...

00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:29.370
Just say flat-out that it's no good.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:31.340
Oh, no, I wouldn't call it "no good"...

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.640
So you're saying it's good?

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:33.480
No...

00:04:33.480 --> 00:04:34.910
So it's no good then, isn't it?

00:04:34.910 --> 00:04:36.440
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:36.440 --> 00:04:37.610
I see.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:38.850
I'm sorry.

00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.880
There's no need for you to apologize, Mia.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.820
No, Mia's the one at fault here.

00:04:42.820 --> 00:04:44.920
Yes, I know.

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:48.860
It's my fault, because I haven't completely
worked out how we'll stage the climax.

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.230
What are you going to do?

00:04:50.230 --> 00:04:52.890
At this rate we can't even build the set.

00:04:52.890 --> 00:04:54.260
I'll just have to give it my best.

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:57.370
All right! Well said! Give it your best then!

00:04:57.370 --> 00:04:59.870
Go at it like there's no tomorrow!
Go at it until you collapse, like Sora!

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:03.130
Yes! I'll go at it until I collapse, like Sora!

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:03.970
I know you want to move on this right away,
but please give Mia a little more time.

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.310
Yes, that's right...

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:05.310
I know you want to move on this right away,
but please give Mia a little more time.

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:06.610
At this rate...

00:05:05.310 --> 00:05:06.610
I know you want to move on this right away,
but please give Mia a little more time.

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.940
I'll just have to give it a try...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:07.940
I know you want to move on this right away,
but please give Mia a little more time.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:08.980
I'll just have to give it a try...

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:08.980
Okay, got it.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:09.940
Thanks.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.810
The seal loved it!

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:45.380
So... was it was a success, then?

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:46.470
It's hard to say.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:55.620
Odile can't express her love in
any other way but hating Odette...

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:00.260
Then that means if she destroys Odette,

00:06:00.260 --> 00:06:03.790
she won't be able to express love anymore.

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:15.440
That's like I was when I couldn't get pumped up
anymore because Sora had left the stage.

00:06:15.440 --> 00:06:17.710
Odile is me...

00:06:19.010 --> 00:06:21.120
What the prince is to Odile

00:06:21.120 --> 00:06:24.520
is what the stage is to me.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:29.780
Odile can't win the prince's love as long as
she keeps trying to defeat Odette.

00:06:30.560 --> 00:06:32.960
The difference between Odette and Odile...

00:06:32.960 --> 00:06:38.270
It's that Odile's love is the most
important thing to her,

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:42.900
but on the other hand Odette values
the prince more than she does herself.

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:47.800
Sora values the stage more than
she does herself.

00:06:48.110 --> 00:06:52.440
As long as I keep trying to defeat Sora,
I can't win.

00:07:01.120 --> 00:07:02.620
Pose number nine.

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.390
Right!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.470
The stage more than yourself, huh?

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:28.280
Sora, don't tell me you're...

00:07:33.190 --> 00:07:36.990
The training seems to involve
more difficult things every day.

00:07:40.660 --> 00:07:41.430
Yes?

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:42.430
Good afternoon.

00:07:42.430 --> 00:07:44.770
Oh, please wait one moment.

00:07:44.770 --> 00:07:47.030
Miss, it's Mr. Yuri.

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.400
Let him in.

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.470
Yes, Miss!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.910
I apologize for the wait. I'll be right there.

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.810
Thank you for waiting! Please come in.

00:07:55.810 --> 00:07:58.280
Miss Layla is in the practice room
in the basement.

00:07:58.280 --> 00:07:59.610
Thanks.

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:01.780
Stubborn, aren't you?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:04.820
If you've got no intention of
becoming my partner, then go home.

00:08:04.820 --> 00:08:06.290
I don't get it.

00:08:06.290 --> 00:08:08.520
To any outside observer,

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:11.960
you making a comeback on the Kaleido Stage
doesn't look too good.

00:08:11.960 --> 00:08:14.360
On the contrary, they could even get
the impression you couldn't let go.

00:08:14.360 --> 00:08:17.070
And if you fail you'll be a laughingstock.

00:08:17.070 --> 00:08:19.300
I don't care what anyone thinks.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:24.030
I have to do this. No matter what.

00:08:36.050 --> 00:08:38.880
To think you're too wiped out
to even take a bath.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:43.160
Oh? What's that? Are you trying
to say something?

00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:45.630
Do you want me to change your clothes?

00:08:45.630 --> 00:08:50.000
Will you... give me... a massage?

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:52.670
How's this? Is this about right?

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:54.430
It's not helping...

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.880
Never mind. Thanks though.

00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.640
For some reason this rankles.

00:09:17.460 --> 00:09:19.090
Like this?

00:09:19.090 --> 00:09:20.630
Oh, there's a bar at the bottom.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:21.800
Stand on that.

00:09:21.800 --> 00:09:22.630
Okay.

00:09:22.630 --> 00:09:24.960
Sora, we're going to start.

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.190
R-Right!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:38.000
It looks like this training
is going to be pretty harsh.

00:09:40.150 --> 00:09:43.820
Maintain your pose on the bar,
no matter what happens.

00:09:43.820 --> 00:09:45.010
Right!

00:10:03.970 --> 00:10:05.010
Rosetta!

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.540
What?

00:10:06.540 --> 00:10:10.380
I'm thinking of making my move during
the climax a two-person move.

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.010
I see.

00:10:12.010 --> 00:10:14.320
I've already cleared it with Cathy.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:15.350
Uh-huh...

00:10:15.350 --> 00:10:16.850
What are you doing zoning out?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.290
If you get what I'm saying,
then let's start practicing!

00:10:18.290 --> 00:10:19.750
Hey, wait!

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:22.660
Didn't I tell you I wasn't going to be in the show?

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.720
Are you really okay with that?

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:28.100
I'm telling you, I am.

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.670
Sora's got no hesitation about this.

00:10:30.670 --> 00:10:32.630
I imagine she'll go through with it,

00:10:32.630 --> 00:10:37.200
even if it means she'll never be able to
perform onstage again.

00:10:39.010 --> 00:10:44.180
When I came to the Kaleido Stage,
Miss Layla wasn't here anymore.

00:10:44.180 --> 00:10:46.780
I can't even tell you how bitterly
disappointing that was.

00:10:46.780 --> 00:10:49.820
The move that I'm thinking of right now
can't be done by one person.

00:10:49.820 --> 00:10:52.320
That's why I'm asking you to do it.

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:55.420
But if you refuse, I'll look for someone else.

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:56.980
What will you do?

00:10:57.360 --> 00:11:00.490
If you seriously want to do this thing,
I'll train you.

00:11:01.100 --> 00:11:02.650
But...

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.530
It'll be hard.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:05.930
May...

00:11:06.570 --> 00:11:09.300
I'll do it. I want to give it a shot!

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:11.700
All right, then.

00:11:22.480 --> 00:11:25.250
Her balance has improved, even if only a little.

00:11:25.790 --> 00:11:28.920
But she doesn't own the pose and
her facial expression is strained.

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:32.230
She's still not at a level where
she can take this onstage.

00:11:32.230 --> 00:11:36.030
Physically, I don't know if Sora will
last out this training...

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:39.500
Okay!

00:11:39.500 --> 00:11:41.440
How about a little change of scene?

00:11:41.440 --> 00:11:42.430
Huh?

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:49.610
Um, where are we going at this time of night?

00:11:49.610 --> 00:11:52.010
You'll find out when we get there!

00:12:10.770 --> 00:12:13.130
The seal seemed to like it.

00:12:13.130 --> 00:12:14.400
Uh-huh...

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.390
That's probably better than nobody liking it.

00:12:36.490 --> 00:12:38.260
Look, Mia.

00:12:38.260 --> 00:12:39.190
Okay.

00:12:41.900 --> 00:12:43.560
Real swans!

00:12:43.560 --> 00:12:47.540
Yep. Mother Nature is the best stage director.

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:50.140
It's good for us to sit back and
be her audience sometimes.

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:51.630
Right.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:56.640
You can't get a firm image of an angel?

00:12:56.640 --> 00:12:58.610
An angel who doesn't fight.

00:12:58.610 --> 00:13:01.280
An angel who loves even her hating heart...

00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:04.120
I thought that suited Sora perfectly, but...

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:05.850
It's too easy and perfect?

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:06.990
Yeah.

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.520
Though that probably sounds funny
coming from me, since I wrote it.

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.630
You see, I'm the same type as May.

00:13:12.630 --> 00:13:15.700
Charging headlong is more my style.

00:13:15.700 --> 00:13:18.400
I always made fun of people who said things like

00:13:18.400 --> 00:13:19.800
"Let's all get along and do this
together as friends."

00:13:19.800 --> 00:13:22.830
I'd say, "You're just cowards who're
afraid of getting hurt!"

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:28.010
But Sora's different from them, isn't she?

00:13:29.040 --> 00:13:33.740
When I tried to make her battle May,
Sora refused.

00:13:34.450 --> 00:13:36.950
May said she was just running away,

00:13:36.950 --> 00:13:40.520
but those weren't the eyes of someone
who was running away.

00:13:40.520 --> 00:13:44.290
Some of our regular players also say
they can't sympathize with Sora

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.430
when she says she won't fight.

00:13:46.430 --> 00:13:49.460
They say "Come on, battle May and
show her a thing or two."

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:51.730
Although those people always
turn out to be the ones

00:13:51.730 --> 00:13:54.770
who don't have the courage to fight themselves.

00:13:54.770 --> 00:13:58.610
Well, but that's about 80% of the people
in this world, so it's a lost cause.

00:13:58.610 --> 00:14:00.240
Um, okay...

00:14:00.240 --> 00:14:03.240
Leon pulled Sora onto the stage, right?

00:14:03.240 --> 00:14:05.850
She gave a lively performance,
undaunted when May came after her.

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:09.650
There was something really thrilling
about Sora then.

00:14:09.650 --> 00:14:13.090
I didn't sense even a hint of the weakness
of someone who was running.

00:14:14.390 --> 00:14:17.890
It's like Sora's battling something, isn't it?

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:23.160
Maybe even inside Sora there's a fear
that the fighting may never stop,

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:26.290
and she's battling that fear.

00:14:39.680 --> 00:14:41.480
How beautiful...

00:14:44.890 --> 00:14:46.420
I see...

00:14:46.420 --> 00:14:49.620
If Sora hadn't made a stage
with no battles her goal,

00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:55.430
maybe she couldn't have come back to
the Kaleido Stage when she did.

00:15:01.270 --> 00:15:05.670
The force of the waves, the force of the wind,
the force of the boat...

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.210
A lot of different forces are mixing together.

00:15:08.210 --> 00:15:11.200
It's more complicated than
the trapeze could ever be.

00:15:11.910 --> 00:15:14.250
Sense the flow of all of the
different forces at work.

00:15:14.250 --> 00:15:16.480
Don't think. Feel with your body.

00:15:16.480 --> 00:15:18.220
With my body?

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:19.450
Yes.

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:23.490
If you do that, you'll always be able to return to
your original position after you jump.

00:15:23.490 --> 00:15:24.490
Right.

00:15:24.490 --> 00:15:26.930
Be careful not to break the pose.

00:15:44.780 --> 00:15:48.370
That's Sora for you. She's already
on the right track.

00:16:23.020 --> 00:16:26.590
The lengths of the trapezes and the distances
between them are different than at Noir Circus,

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.790
so you can't use the same timing you did then.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:30.190
Right!

00:16:31.930 --> 00:16:33.660
You can't let your body relax!

00:16:33.660 --> 00:16:36.630
That's happening because you're not
picturing your next move!

00:16:40.900 --> 00:16:47.110
Your role is that of a fairy who guides me out of
the dark path of hatred I've wandered down.

00:16:47.110 --> 00:16:51.050
What I have to express isn't hatred;

00:16:51.050 --> 00:16:54.450
it's Odile trying to defeat her own hatred.

00:16:54.450 --> 00:16:58.920
Even if she has to get help from someone
who will guide her with strong power.

00:16:58.920 --> 00:17:00.680
May...

00:17:01.520 --> 00:17:05.120
And if my guide is that timid
it ain't gonna happen!

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:08.260
We're going to get this basic stuff over with fast

00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:11.460
and move on to the special training
for the Eternal Illusion!

00:17:12.030 --> 00:17:14.400
"Eternal Illusion"?

00:17:26.010 --> 00:17:27.070
So close...

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:33.350
I see, so my timing was too fast that time.

00:17:33.350 --> 00:17:36.960
I'm surprised you got to this level on your own.

00:17:36.960 --> 00:17:39.590
It's no good if I'm still thinking about it.

00:17:39.590 --> 00:17:42.190
I have to sense it directly with my body.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:45.500
Try changing the way you channel
your strength each time.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:47.200
Do it like this is the real thing.

00:17:47.200 --> 00:17:48.690
Okay.

00:17:48.770 --> 00:17:52.340
Oh, this warms me up! Thanks, Miss Sarah!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:57.550
I gave Japanese pork miso soup a try.
I'm glad you like it!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:01.180
It's a shame I'm so tired that I can't really taste it.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:04.150
Oh, that's too bad! And I felt pretty
confident about it too!

00:18:04.150 --> 00:18:06.590
I tried adding a bunch of fresh cream.

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.660
Is it nice? Is it nice?

00:18:08.660 --> 00:18:09.390
Maybe it's a good thing I can't really taste it.

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:11.020
Oh, good!

00:18:09.390 --> 00:18:11.020
Maybe it's a good thing I can't really taste it.

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:12.790
Say, Leon, do you want some too?

00:18:12.790 --> 00:18:14.030
No.

00:18:14.030 --> 00:18:18.070
Mother Nature... Swans...
The Angel's Maneuver...

00:18:18.070 --> 00:18:19.670
Not right.

00:18:19.670 --> 00:18:21.860
Ugh, this is too hard!

00:18:25.840 --> 00:18:27.780
What if I ran like this?

00:18:27.780 --> 00:18:30.340
Do you think the seal would like that?

00:18:30.340 --> 00:18:32.980
Okay, the seal doesn't have to like it.

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:34.450
Oh, right!

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:38.920
This is agony.

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.890
I've started wanting to run away.

00:18:42.990 --> 00:18:44.890
Looks like she's about at her limit.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:51.270
I wanted to run away when I was training for
the Legendary Great Maneuver too,

00:18:51.270 --> 00:18:53.760
because it hurt so bad.

00:18:54.300 --> 00:18:56.540
The reason I could give it my all back then

00:18:56.540 --> 00:18:59.470
was because Miss Layla led me on.

00:18:59.470 --> 00:19:05.180
But Miss Layla gave it her all right through to
the end just on her own power.

00:19:05.180 --> 00:19:07.650
Without help from anyone.

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:13.280
What?!

00:19:22.230 --> 00:19:23.530
She did it!

00:19:30.400 --> 00:19:32.110
Amazing!

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:35.700
Layla really is an amazing performer.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:40.440
It should get better and better...

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:48.920
Huh?

00:19:50.360 --> 00:19:52.390
This show is gonna be amazing!

00:19:52.390 --> 00:19:54.760
Be sure to come see it, okay?

00:19:54.760 --> 00:19:57.670
I wonder if I could meet the lead, Sora Naegino.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:59.200
Are you a fan of Sora's?

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:00.530
I suppose so.

00:20:00.530 --> 00:20:03.970
Sora's been training at sea for days.

00:20:03.970 --> 00:20:05.200
Look.

00:20:25.860 --> 00:20:27.960
Wh-What is that maneuver?

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:30.930
Is that the true Angel's Maneuver?

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:40.740
It's so pretty...

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.780
Amazing...

00:20:42.780 --> 00:20:46.230
She's like an angel... no, she IS an angel!

00:20:52.690 --> 00:20:55.820
I just got an amazing idea.

00:20:55.820 --> 00:20:57.380
What should I do?

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:05.200
The only way to beat Sora is to
play the very best Odile.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:08.640
I'm going to make this show the very best show.

00:21:08.640 --> 00:21:11.930
I want to make my dream come true
on this stage.

00:21:14.580 --> 00:21:18.080
Everyone's hearts are starting to become one.

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:22.540
Leon, that's the stage of a true star.

00:21:25.990 --> 00:21:30.950
Sophie, it looks like I'm finally going to
be able to keep my promise to you.

00:21:31.730 --> 00:21:34.760
I'll practice more and more right up
until opening day,

00:21:34.760 --> 00:21:37.730
and I'll make the true Kaleido Star
a reality no matter what!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:39.670
Hold on.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:42.140
There's another candidate for the role of Odette.

00:21:42.140 --> 00:21:43.370
What?

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:46.470
Tomorrow, we'll be holding an audition
for the role of Odette.

00:21:46.470 --> 00:21:47.640
Audition?

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.010
Who is this "other candidate"?

00:21:49.010 --> 00:21:49.780
May?

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:51.640
What's this about?

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:08.280
Miss Layla!

00:22:10.060 --> 00:22:12.500
The contest is on, Sora.

00:22:12.500 --> 00:22:15.490
If you don't like it, step down from your role.

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>All kinds of hard luck flocks your way
as if it's spurring you on</i>

00:22:31.650 --> 00:22:34.960
<i>Sekasu you ni muragaru Hard luck</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Swept away by it, time is over</i>

00:22:34.960 --> 00:22:38.190
<i>Nagasarete Time is over</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Just as it was predicted, take it easy</i>

00:22:39.190 --> 00:22:42.000
<i>Yokoku douri Take it easy</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>I will get you out right away</i>

00:22:42.000 --> 00:22:46.430
<i>Tsuredasu yo imasugu</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (Here we go)</i>

00:22:46.430 --> 00:22:48.140
<i>Hurry up (here we go)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Forcibly only (Drive with the fastest speed)</i>

00:22:48.140 --> 00:22:50.100
<i>Gouin only (saisoku drive)</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>The view I look down at every day is the best</i>

00:22:50.100 --> 00:22:53.370
<i>Nichijo miorosu best view</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (Favorite)</i>

00:22:53.740 --> 00:22:55.810
<i>Sunset point (favorite)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (Stormy night)</i>

00:22:55.810 --> 00:22:57.710
<i>Harbor light (stormy night)</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Escape for the sake of tomorrow</i>

00:22:57.710 --> 00:23:01.510
<i>Asuno tame ni escape</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Even I don't have a vacation,
I've got an oasis</i>

00:23:02.420 --> 00:23:08.190
<i>Bakansu nashi demo oashisu wa get</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>I'll turn off the cell phone
and charge my love</i>

00:23:08.190 --> 00:23:14.620
<i>Keitai off tte ai o charge shite</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Because some pain,
you can't soothe with just kindness</i>

00:23:15.230 --> 00:23:19.470
<i>Yasashisa dake ja iyasenai itami mo aru kara</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. We pass each other</i>

00:23:19.470 --> 00:23:23.330
<i>We are alone. Surechigau</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:23.770 --> 00:23:24.740
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>At the far end of regret,
I encounter my true heart</i>

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:30.000
<i>Koukai no hate ni deau true heart</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Whether I'm crying or laughing,
I will be with you</i>

00:23:30.640 --> 00:23:37.380
<i>Naite mo waratte mo I'll be with U</i>

00:23:40.550 --> 00:23:42.750
Next Kaleido Star: New Wings

00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:46.990
Back then, I never dreamed a day
like this would come.

00:23:47.490 --> 00:23:50.100
I'm here because of my admiration for you.

00:23:50.100 --> 00:23:52.500
Your kindness, and your harshness...

00:23:52.500 --> 00:23:55.400
The warmth we felt that day...
I won't forget those things.

00:23:55.400 --> 00:23:59.740
Look at how much I've grown!

